        "Description": "Welcome to Colorado 47\r \rRobert Powell recently lost his kitchen knife and cleaver, later he and his  colleagues recovered them from Issac and his retarded buddies, in a High Security area why those guys even needed to steal kitchen utensils anyways? Anyhow Robert smells a rat and maybe someone inside wanted to murder him so he wants to return the favour.\r\rGood Hunting",
